#: ../../source/performance.rst:7
msgid ""
"Under the Resend.com free tier, the system is constrained to **100 emails"
" per day**. At the current send rate of one email per 2-minute cron "
"trigger, the theoretical maximum is 720 sends per day — well above the "
"quota. In practice, the daily quota is the binding constraint."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/performance.rst:9
msgid ""
"At 100 emails/day against a list of 6,369 recipients, a full cycle "
"completes in approximately **64 days**."
msgstr ""

