#: ../../source/performance.rst:45
msgid "Quota Reset"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/performance.rst:47
msgid ""
"The Resend.com free tier quota resets at **midnight UTC** daily. The cron"
" job continues running through the quota period; sends during quota "
"exhaustion are logged as ``daily_quota_exceeded`` and automatically "
"resume when quota refreshes."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/performance.rst:50
msgid "Server Load"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/performance.rst:52
msgid ""
"The system imposes negligible load on the EC2 instance. Node.js spawns, "
"sends one HTTP request, and exits within ~1 second. The server load "
"average at time of observation was 2.25/2.52/1.79 (primarily driven by "
"other workloads on the machine)."
msgstr ""

